OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies and pedestrian
OL,4,Ainjured after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died and a
OL,7,Fpedestrian has been seriously injured
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to Narborough Road South,
OL,12,FBraunstone Town, at about 22:35 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThe motorbike - a grey Yamaha FZ1 ` was
OL,16,Ftravelling on the service road in
OL,17,FNarborough Road South and the
OL,18,Fpedestrian was in the road at the time
OL,19,Fof the crash, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
