OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies and pedestrian
OL,4,Ainjured after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rider of the motorbike, a
OL,7,F30-year-old man, was taken to his
OL,8,Fhospital where he died from his
OL,9,Finjuries in the early hours of Friday.
OL,10,FThe pedestrian, a 39-year-old man, is
OL,11,Fcurrently in hospital with serious
OL,12,Finjuries.
